          "tool_input": {
            "command": "create",
            "path": "/memories/session/kit-investigation-findings.md",
            "file_text": "# Kit App Table Rendering Investigation\n\n## Location of Kit App\n- Component: [semio/js/sketchpad/Kit.tsx](semio/js/sketchpad/Kit.tsx)\n- Table rendering: Line 6500-6984 (AppContent component)\n- Internal state: Line 270-3357\n\n## Findings\n\n### 1. **showTypes Button ID Mismatch**\n- **Test expects**: `button[id=\"semio.sketchpad.app.kit.kitApp.showTypes\"]`\n- **Actual implementation**: `button[id=\"semio.sketchpad.app.kit.toolbar.showTypes\"]`\n- **Location**: [Kit.tsx#L4357](semio/js/sketchpad/Kit.tsx#L4357)\n- **Component**: `KitKindToggles` component (line 4345+)\n\n### 2. **data-row-id Attribute**\n- **IS being set correctly**: [semio-elements/ui/elements.tsx](semio-elements/ui/elements.tsx) line 8232 and 8270\n- The Table component does set `data-row-id={rowId}` on all `\u003ctr\u003e` elements\n- Both draggable and normal rows have this attribute\n\n### 3. **tbody Element**\n- **IS being rendered**: The Table component renders `\u003ctbody\u003e` at line 8268 in elements.tsx\n- Code at [Kit.tsx#L5915](semio/js/sketchpad/Kit.tsx#L5915) queries for tbody correctly\n\n### 4. **Table Row Data Source**\nThe rows are populated via:\n- Data prop: `data={rows}` at line 6770+ (Kit.tsx)\n- rowId getter: `getRowId={(row) =\u003e row.id}`\n- Rows are created by `buildTableRows()` function that transforms Kit data (types, designs, qualities, etc.) into `TableRow` objects\n- Row structure includes: `id`, `kind`, `data`, `level`, `hasChildren`, `isExpanded`, `artifact` (display name), etc.\n\n### 5. **Root Cause Analysis**\nThe test failures are likely due to:\n1. **Button ID mismatch** - Tests are looking for wrong button ID\n2. **Table not rendering or being empty** - Likely the rows array is empty or not being populated correctly\n3. **Data flow issue** - The `selectedKindsFromUrl` may not include all needed kinds by default, filtering out types/designs/etc.\n\n## Test File\n- Location: [semio/js/sketchpad.test.ts](semio/js/sketchpad.test.ts)\n- Failing test functions: `initType()` at line 544, 1077, 1469\n- Test expectations:\n  - Button visibility with old ID\n  - Elements with `data-row-id` attribute\n  - Text nodes like \"Tambour\", \"Nakagin Capsule Tower\"\n"
